@api = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness: the process is running
GET {{api}}/health/live

### Readiness: the database is reachable
GET {{api}}/health/ready

### Unknown route: 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{api}}/does-not-exist

### Games list (website-only: uses the development internal key)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/games?lang=es
X-Internal-Key: local-development-internal-key

### One game with its achievements
GET {{api}}/api/v1/games/zelda64-recompiled
X-Internal-Key: local-development-internal-key

### Create an account (the confirmation link is printed in the API console in Development)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/register
X-Internal-Key: local-development-internal-key
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "player@example.com", "password": "local test password", "username": "player1", "locale": "en" }

### Sign in (after confirming the email); returns a session token
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/sign-in
X-Internal-Key: local-development-internal-key
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "player@example.com", "password": "local test password" }

### The signed-in account (paste the token from sign-in)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/auth/me
X-Internal-Key: local-development-internal-key
Authorization: Bearer paste-the-session-token-here
